# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern
README.md

# Hand-written webhook signature verifier (Fern's generated verifier can't parse the compound
# `ElevenLabs-Signature: t=...,v0=...` header). Standalone rather than a method on the generated
# WebhooksClient, which Java can't extend without freezing that whole generated file.
